      "contract": "Put r=norm(y-x), t=r^2/(2eta). r<=1+r^2 and t exp(-t)<=exp(-1)<=1 yield r K<=1+2eta; innerSL_apply_norm gives norm(D_yK)<=b_eta=(1+2eta)/eta. True in rank0; do not use Nontrivial-only innerSL_norm.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.integrand",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "F(y,x)=f(2*x-y)*K(y,x). Actual derivative G(y,x)=-K(y,x) scalar-multiply fderiv_R f(2*x-y) - (f(2*x-y)*K(y,x)/eta) scalar-multiply innerSL_R(y-x). Both negative signs genuine. NormF<=Mf, normG<=Mdf+Mf*b_eta.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.typing",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "E and its real continuous-linear-functional space have actual finite-dimensional metrizable/separable typing, real Banach target and real normed scalar action. These internally discharge the neighborhood/first-countability/strong measurability/CLM integral contracts; no extra class hypothesis.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.meas",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "From genuine continuous f, fderiv and Gaussian/affine maps derive F(y,.) and G(y,.) strongly/AES measurable for every y; G(.,x) continuous for every x. Also f strongly measurable for map integral. These are real analytic obligations, not arbitrary versions.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.L1",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Probability mu supplies finite measure; constant Mf and B=Mdf+Mf*b_eta are integrable. Actual AES+global pointwise bounds give F(y,.) and G(y,.) L1 and K(y,.) L1 for every y, without any moment hypothesis.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.Nderiv",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "N(y)=integral F(y,x) dmu. For each y0 use s=univ (one genuine neighborhood independent of x), actual AES, F(y0) L1, G(y0) AES, B L1, and all-x/y actual derivatives to produce HasFDerivAt N (integral G(y0,x)dmu) y0.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.NprimeCont",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Use the same global constant B and real G measurability/parameter continuity in CLM-valued continuous_of_dominated. The actual derivative field Nprime(y)=integral G(y,x)dmu is continuous.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.NC1",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "C1 characterization combines all-y actual derivatives with actual continuous Nprime to give C1N, not just Differentiable N.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.ZL1",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Parent literal Z(y)=integral K(y,x)dmu is actual nonnegative finite real mass (K positive and <=1, mu probability). Positive parent C*Z rules out Z=0; combined with integral nonnegativity gives Z>0. This needs no caller C positivity and no law/limit certificate.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.ZC1",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "The opaque parent produces C2Z at exact eta and mu. Internally lower derivative order to C1 via ContDiff.of_le; use exact actual Z, not an existential surrogate.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.posterior",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Actual tilted definition gives R_y=mu.withDensity(ofReal(K/Z)); positivity and real L1 normalization internally imply probability R_y and true measurable reflected map gives probability S_y. Law probability is internally derived, no new public certificate. Normalization calculation is an obligation, not a theorem output credit.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.meanIdentity",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Every y: integral f(u) dS_y = integral f(2*x-y) dR_y = integral (K(y,x)/Z(y))*f(2*x-y) dmu = N(y)/Z(y). Use actual measurable map, strongly measurable f, literal integral_tilted, scalar integral extraction and norm symmetry. No AE replacement of laws.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.meanC1",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Actual C1N, actual C1Z and all-y Z>0 give C1(N/Z). Substitute the everywhere identity to obtain exact sealed target.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "O52.zeroSign",
      "kind": "authored-internal-obligation",
      "contract": "Signed f and zeros allowed throughout norms/products; no positivity/centering of f. In rank0 actual Z=1 and literal mean constant, derivative zero; no positive dimension or Nontrivial E premise.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
      "proof_body_expanded": false,
      "formal_status": "UNIMPLEMENTED_INTERNAL_SOURCE_OBLIGATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "R52.gibbsAdapter",
      "kind": "typed-residual",
      "contract": "LATER TYPED RESIDUAL: For actual paper mu=volume.tilted(-V), internally produced positive finite ZV and exp(-V) L1, affine u=2x-y, volume Jacobian2^-dim, tilt composition/normalization must prove literal generic S_y equals actual50 source volume-tilt S_y EVERY y. No AE uniqueness derivative transport and no pointwise-law certificate premise.",
      "qualified_id": null,
