      "contract": "LATER TYPED RESIDUAL: After genuine pointwise same-S function identity, transfer C1 to actual50 literal Tf; combine actual50 two genuine Lp representatives and actual51 same-nu closable graph with c1_in_closed_gradient. Current52 gives neither adapter nor graph membership.",
      "qualified_id": null,
      "compiled52": false,
